    "order": 320,
    "content": "# VI Datetime Custom Formatting\n\nUse `%`-style datetime tokens with `datetime` value helpers.\n\n## Example\n```versa\ndatetime import *;\n\nlet format: dtf = \"%A, %d %B %Y %H:%M:%S\";\nprint(datetime.now().human(format));\n\nlet tz = datetime.timezone(\"+02:00\");\nprint(tz.human());\n```\n\n## Common format tokens\n- `%Y` year (4-digit)\n- `%m` month (01-12)\n- `%d` day (01-31)\n- `%H` hour 24h (00-23)\n- `%M` minute (00-59)\n- `%S` second (00-59)\n- `%A` full weekday name\n- `%a` short weekday name\n- `%B` full month name\n- `%b` short month name\n- `%I` hour 12h\n- `%p` AM/PM\n- `%z` UTC offset\n- `%Z` zone name\n- `%f` microseconds"
